      "source": [
        "# Decorator\n",
        "\n",
        "A decorator transforms a function or class at definition time. For example, `@decorator` above a function applies `decorator` to the newly defined function and binds the result to its name.\n",
        "\n",
        "Source: [Python glossary](https://docs.python.org/3/glossary.html#term-decorator)"
      ]
    }
  ],
